### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 获取力量标准数据
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fitness/standards?exercise=bench_press&gender=male

### 注册/登录用户
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "password123",
  "gender": "male",
  "age": 25,
  "height": 175,
  "weight": 70,
  "nickname": "健身达人"
}

### 评估力量水平（需要token）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/fitness/assess
GET http://localhost:3000/api/fitness/assess
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessments": [
    {
      "exercise": "bench_press",
      "oneRepMax": 85
    },
    {
      "exercise": "deadlift",
      "oneRepMax": 150
    },
    {
      "exercise": "squat",
      "oneRepMax": 120
    }
  ],
  "ageGroup": "25-39"
}